      "writtenOn": "2023-06-12T18:07:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "GN is configured to ignore warnings in *all* third_party rules. Bazel lacks such a blanket mechanism.\n\nhttps://github.com/google/skia/blob/673db113b560015e4e9e943ca44b1a13b5e67022/third_party/third_party.gni#L91\n\nThis looks fine to me.",
