      "writtenOn": "2023-06-12T18:14:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, that explains why GN isn\u0027t failing, but I don\u0027t think that means it is safe. Using the wrong format specifiers can very easily lead to a crash, and expat has #defines to control which format specifiers we get. I believe we haven\u0027t set those #defines so we\u0027re just getting arbitrary results.",
      "parentUuid": "3f6c6375_0d9c458b",
      "range": {
