      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do we convert to `vector\u003cchar\u003e` here and then back to `std::string` below?\n\nAppending the guid doesn\u0027t require it.\n`append_uint32` doesn\u0027t require it (it could just as easily take a `std::string` and work the same).",
